      "At CyTOS Engineering in Pune, Maharashtra, we have developed the flagship VDM (Vertical Drilling and Milling) series built to our uncompromising standard: Factor of Safety 2.0 and 24x7 Continuous Duty Rating. This comprehensive guide examines the mechanical architecture, spindle dynamics, and economic metrics of modern industrial heavy vertical milling centers.",
