    "slug": "heavy-duty-cnc-router-machine-guide",
    "title": "Heavy Duty CNC Router Machine: Ball Screw vs Rack & Pinion for Aluminum & Composites",
    "metaDescription": "Selection guide for a heavy duty CNC router machine. Compare Class C3 ball screws vs helical rack-and-pinion, tubular steel gantries, and vacuum beds.",
