    "title": "Mechanical PCB Drilling vs Laser Drilling: Cost, Throughput & Aspect Ratio Comparison",
    "metaDescription": "Compare mechanical PCB drilling vs UV/CO2 laser drilling. Discover the cost crossover threshold, blind micro-via limitations, and thick FR4 processing.",
