    "title": "PCB Drilling Machine: The Definitive 2026 High-Speed Industrial Selection Guide",
    "metaDescription": "Comprehensive guide to selecting an industrial PCB drilling machine. Compare 60,000 RPM air-bearing vs mechanical spindles, TIR runout, and IPC-2221 tolerances.",
